{"id":"41f4691c9a274852","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-thm-pcf-independence.md","title":"Basic PCF Maximum Theorem","display":"thm-pcf-independence — Basic PCF Maximum Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-pcf-independence","aliases":["58-thm-pcf-independence"],"display":"thm-pcf-independence — Basic PCF Maximum Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-pcf-independence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-pcf-independence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pcf-independence — Basic PCF Maximum Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md\">../batch06/58-df-pcf.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> is a nonempty progressive set of regular cardinals</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> is the possible-cofinalities operation</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the regular-cardinal predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对非空序数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min C\\coloneqq\\iota c\\;(c\\in C\\land\\forall d\\in C\\;(c\\subseteq d))\">\\(\\min C\\coloneqq\\iota c\\;(c\\in C\\land\\forall d\\in C\\;(c\\subseteq d))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 仅在唯一见证存在时取值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>有效输入条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\ne\\varnothing\\land(\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa))\\land |A|&lt;\\min A\">\\(A\\ne\\varnothing\\land(\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa))\\land |A|&lt;\\min A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"58-df-pcf.md\">58-df-pcf.md</a> 的同一有效域。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}independence}\\vdash\nA\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\bigr)\n\\land |A|&lt;\\min A\n\\to\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;\n\\forall\\mu\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;(\\mu\\leq\\lambda).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}independence}\\vdash\nA\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\bigr)\n\\land |A|&lt;\\min A\n\\to\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;\n\\forall\\mu\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;(\\mu\\leq\\lambda).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the fundamental ZFC maximum theorem for progressive sets in PCF theory; the old “independence” formula was unrelated to PCF.</li>\n<li>Nonemptiness is explicit because <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min A\">\\(\\min A\\)</span> is otherwise undefined.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md","status":"resolved","id":"b82cea6742372d50","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ is the regular-cardinal predicate from [[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-pcf.md","status":"resolved","id":"b82cea6742372d50","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"有效输入条件为 $A\\ne\\varnothing\\land(\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa))\\land |A|<\\min A$；$\\operatorname{pcf}$ 采用 [[58-df-pcf.md]] 的同一有效域。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}:V\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\min C\\coloneqq\\iota c\\;(c\\in C\\land\\forall d\\in C\\;(c\\subseteq d))","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"A\\ne\\varnothing\\land(\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa))\\land |A|<\\min A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}independence}\\vdash\nA\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\bigr)\n\\land |A|<\\min A\n\\to\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;\n\\forall\\mu\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;(\\mu\\leq\\lambda).","display":true},{"tex":"\\min A","display":false}],"bytes":1636,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4346","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-thm-pcf-independence.md|58-thm-pcf-independence]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["b82cea6742372d50","0fbfc19800246e77","5fb1c2241d1943d1","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}